<title>USA: First Republic Bancorp Q4 net, shr up.</title>
<headline>First Republic Bancorp Q4 net, shr up.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.11		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net		 335			156</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.10		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net		 2,700		    603</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Total assets at December 31, 1996 were $274 million with total loans outstanding of $170 million. Total shareholders' equity stood at about $18.3 million or $6.44 book value per share at December 31, 1996 with outstanding common shares of 2,847,969.</p>
<p>Tier I leverage capital and total risk-based capital at December 31, 1996 stood at 6.74 and 11.18 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
